    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isiraili ladwoko bongi Rwoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigipiny me je labino kwoŋ win, silwany je kodi lam je, m'aketho ruwaŋ win, aka wilapoyo i cuny win, i dier nonin je kama Rwoth lajwang'iye win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka wiladwoko bongi Rwoth Were mewin, to wiwinjo dwondi go, paka amiyo win or konon, win kodi nyithindho mewin, gi cuny win je kodi kwo mewin je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Rwoth Were mewin ladwoko win wok i twec mewin, to mako gi win wor, aka go lawire to coko win wok i dier nonin kama Rwoth Were mewin okedh'iye win koro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makada nende bedi nike go oyido ojwango win i gike ma polo, Rwoth Were mewin lacoko win, aka go ladwoko win wok koro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Were mewin lakelo win i lowo ma kwarere mewin jolunjo, wilalunjo, aka lakadho maber gi win, aka go laloko win mathoth loyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth layomo cuny win kodi cuny nyikway win, ŋey wimar Rwoth Were mewin gi cuny win je kodi kwo mewin je, ŋey wibedi makwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth laketho lam me je kwoŋ jokwor mewin kodi jono ma jodak win, ma jomiyo win litho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka wilagik winjo dwondi Rwoth kodi timo or pere je paka amiyo win or konon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Were mewin lamiyo win ŋaŋo mathoth i tic ma cingi win je, nywol mewin, nywol p'ogwaŋe mewin kodi ranyak ma lowo mewin. Kole lakisangala Rwoth miyo win bero paka osangala go miyo kwarere mewin bero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka winowinji dwondi Rwoth Were mewin, kuro or pere kodi fonji pere m'ondiki i kitawo ma cik me, ka winowire bongi Rwoth Were mewin gi cuny win je kodi kwo mewin je.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole or m'amiyo win or kwoŋe konon me kitek riwin, kosa kibor gi win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.6+ROM.10.7+ROM.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 10:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinitie i polo, ma winowaci ni, ŋa ma laidho riwan i polo ŋey wonyali omo riwan, aka ŋey wanyal winjo to watimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosa kinitie i thengi nam ca, ma winowaci ni, ŋa m'ocewere kadho i thengi nam yukoca, ŋey wonyali omo riwan, aka ŋey wanyal winjo to watimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole wac nitie cegin swa gi win, i dhok win kodi i cuny win ŋey winyal timo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni ee, aketho ruwaŋ win konon me, kwo kodi bero, tho kodi teko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paka amiyo win or konon me, maro Rwoth Were mewin, wotho i yo pere, kuro or pere, fonji pere, cik pere, wilakwo to wimedo nyay, aka Rwoth Were mewin lamiyo win silwany i lowo ma wicegin kadh'iye koro lunjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka cuny win owire woko, to wikwero winjo, aka winorweny to wicako lamo werin man kodi tiyo rijo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awaco riwin nike wilatho adieri. Ndelo mewin k'obedi mabor i lowo ma wicegin ŋado Yordan kadho yukoro lunjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alwoŋo polo kodi piny bedo paka jokony kwoŋ win konon me, nike atieko ketho ruwaŋ win kwo kodi tho, silwany kodi lam. Yer win kwo ŋey winyal kwo, win kodi nyikway win, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
